#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:222
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Performansa"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:224
msgid ""
"If Pipeline performs badly on your device, you may want to change some of "
"those settings. In general, keeping the default settings is recommended. For "
"older devices which do not support GLES 3.0 like the PinePhone, you may want "
"to switch to software rendering. Changing these settings require a restart "
"of Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Ako Pipeline loše radi na tvom uređaju, možda pomogne ako promijeniš neke od "
"tih postavki. Općenito se preporučuje zadržati zadane postavke. Za starije "
"uređaje koji ne podržavaju GLES 3.0, poput PinePhonea, pokušaj prebaciti na "
"prikaz putem softvera. Promjena tih postavki zahtijeva ponovno pokretanje "
"Pipelinea."

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:228
msgid "Software Rendering"
msgstr "Prikaz putem softvera"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:229
msgid "Using the Cairo renderer"
msgstr "Korištenje Cairo biblioteke za prikaz"

#: data/resources/ui/privacy_notice.blp:30
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Odbaci"

#: data/resources/ui/privacy_notice.blp:47
msgid ""
"Pipeline connects directly to YouTube and PeerTube for getting data and when "
"playing videos. Pipeline can be configured to use Piped for retrieving "
"Youtube data, but videos are still played over YouTube"
msgstr ""
"Pipeline se izravno povezuje s YouTubeom i PeerTubeom za dohvaćanje podataka "
"i reprodukciju videa. Pipeline se može konfigurirati za korištenje Pipeda za "
"dohvaćanje podataka s YouTubea, ali videa se i dalje reproduciraju preko "
"YouTubea"

